<title>CANADA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM CANADIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM CANADIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-08-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Canadian Open</p>
<p>tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat 7-Conchita Martinez 6-2 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>5-Anke Huber (Germany beat 10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) 3-6</p>
<p>6-2 retired (wrist tendinitis)</p>
